                "description": "Results per page."
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "List memories scoped by filters, paginated. Entity IDs **must** be passed inside the `filters` object — top-level `user_id` / `agent_id` / `run_id` are rejected with 400. `filters` supports the same operator set as V2 search (`AND`, `OR`, `NOT`, `in`, `gte`, `lte`, etc.). Response is a paginated envelope; pass `page` and `page_size` as query parameters to step through results."
        },
